  "description": "Watercolor tropical leaves brush stamps for Procreate\nCompatibility: These brushes will ONLY work in the Procreate iPad app. They won’t work in Photoshop or any other application. They work best with the Apple Pencil.\nTropical leaves brushes for painting in Procreate! Includes 35 stamp brushes + 3 watercolor brushes. You can use pre-made stamps and create your own. These are cute brushes that will help you make a unique design, quickly decorate an illustration, layout, card, invitation to a children’s party, menu and much more. You are only limited by your imagination. This set will give you 35 Procreate Stamp Brushes.\nIt’s easy to create cute images for invitations, stationery, printed materials, Instagram posts, wall art, packaging, graphic designs, templates, or anything else you can think of to create something amazing.\nThe set includes:\n– Tropical leaves (35 stamp brushes)\n– watercolor brushes (3 pieces for coloring the background, leaves and detailing)\nWhat you need:\n– Create procreate app\n– iPad\n– Apple pencil\n– Imagination",
